 /// Hash complete held stages without grouping by their keys.
 ///
 /// Processes in 16-stage blocks so `HeldWorkspace<16>` (12 KiB) stays hot in
 /// L1D cache and avoids a 117 KiB stack frame. Sixteen stages (256 KiB of
 /// leaves; 128/64/32/16 parents) is an exact multiple of both 16 (SME2) and
 /// 8 (NEON) at every parent level.


